---
<section id="services" class="py-24 px-6 bg-surface">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-16 fade-up">
      <span class="section-label mb-3 block">OUR BUSINESS</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">事業内容</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm max-w-xl mx-auto">
        スマート充電技術を核に、IoT・再生可能エネルギー分野で多彩なソリューションを展開しています。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
      {services.map((s, i) => (
        <div
          class="fade-up bg-white rounded-lg p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 border border-gray-100 group"
          style={`transition-delay: ${i * 60}ms`}
        >
          <div class="text-primary group-hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-300 mb-4">
            <Fragment set:html={s.icon} />
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-gray-900 font-semibold text-sm mb-2">{s.title}</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs leading-relaxed">{s.desc}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
